{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_title", "source_sha256": "248093bbf5c03f1f5baea1c3c76dbbcc202dc2d58ad2b2a4b0160574e0550ec7", "ja": "『蒼い鳥』", "zh": "『苍鸟』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e087d2eaba6149048db1b2ad85cd30615c17195eadc36111ad4fde7537e63bef", "ja": "次の定期公演で『蒼い鳥』を歌う千早に一日\n密着取材が。劇場で歌うのは無意識に避けて\nいたと語る千早は、なぜ今歌うのかと問われ\n「自分を知ってほしかったから」と答える。\nこの歌があまりに己自身だからこそ。", "zh": "千早将在下一次定期公演中演唱《苍鸟》，\n并接受了为期一天的跟拍采访。千早坦言自己\n过去下意识地回避在剧场演唱这首歌，\n而当被问及为何选择在此刻演唱时，她回答\n“因为想让大家了解现在的自己”。\n正因这首歌，深刻地映射出了她自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1000_se", "source_sha256": "ad0fc7fbe8e1b206637b7602dd570916e8968406a1ec0058e316e4dde065ab72", "ja": "パチパチパチパチパチ……！", "zh": "啪啪啪啪啪……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "84ab2009bb84c65763939758590e31b0dd5b7694c324c1350c3dc4369d52d113", "ja": "みなさん、ありがとうございます。\n如月千早で、『蒼い鳥』でした。", "zh": "谢谢大家。\n我是如月千早，刚才演唱的是《蒼い鳥》。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "67a1f0ca9026273b40cd47c1732ca3a5beef8d0cd422264ee8e461f7c10a9530", "ja": "久しぶりの披露に驚かれた方、初めて聞いたという方。\n色んな方がいらっしゃると思います。", "zh": "想必有人会因这次久违的演出而感到惊讶，也有人是第一次听到这首歌吧。蕴含着各种各样的感受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "28019b1435cbce9b39f9b4e8b67ec395c2924d3657be3040b700a05256b0a0d3", "ja": "今はただ、この曲とともにある私……。\n如月千早が、みなさんに届いていたら嬉しいです。", "zh": "此刻的我，只愿与这首歌同在……。\n如果如月千早能通过这首歌传达到大家心中，我会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1004_se", "source_sha256": "ad0fc7fbe8e1b206637b7602dd570916e8968406a1ec0058e316e4dde065ab72", "ja": "パチパチパチパチパチ……！", "zh": "啪啪啪啪啪……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "18df22255c0b1aae72bd1cbc15fa7f0b4b6a2b533fffadd632b20e75c3c9e8ee", "ja": "{$P$}！　お疲れ様でし……？\nあの、まだカメラが回って？", "zh": "{$P$}！辛苦了……？那个，摄像机还在拍吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1006_p", "source_sha256": "bfc801c10bbadea951c3de14d2c2e851f617263e0721f4b43820df6bfa8cf529", "ja": "ああ、TVでは公演が終わるまでの密着番組にして\nもらう予定だから。でも、もうすぐ終了だな。", "zh": "啊，因为电视台那边打算制作从公演开始到结束的跟拍节目。不过，也快要结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "8c17594e5ebd75f02a7780f83d1a4c7c54d74b6099c1c5f9b0d2d02379c1143e", "ja": "千早ちゃーん！　ステキだったわ～！\n本当に、これぞ千早ちゃんって感じだった！", "zh": "千早——！太精彩了～！\n真的，这就是千早的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "82599f896465449beae36f9b39ccd4df3c78450b025988c58b6b347298b49794", "ja": "それに、とっても胸に響いて。\n私も涙が出そうになっちゃった……くすん。", "zh": "而且真的特别打动人心，我都差点要哭出来了……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "8914c43d94e9a5bac3829388e8f52f83df3a273d2427272d44690554647d47cd", "ja": "ありさはもう完全に出ています～！　ぐしゅん……！\nなんて、なんて尊いステージなんでしょう！　うう～！", "zh": "亚利沙已经完全哭出来了～！呜呜……！\n这是多么、多么尊贵的舞台啊！呜呜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "81758b8a5053def753cb4aa8614391f73c1395ff06dcabe9f65a02d0189efc16", "ja": "亜利沙ちゃん待って、我慢しなきゃ！\nこのあと私たちのステージもあるんだから、ね？", "zh": "亚利沙，等一下，得忍住才行！\n接下来还有我们的舞台呢，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "2c2d7e54083001f1c0783ba88eee35484362e1067debbe416da509ad3b3b8398", "ja": "ひっ、そうでした……！　えぐっ。でも、どうせ\n客席の皆さんも大洪水なので大丈夫なのでは～ぐすっ。", "zh": "呜，确实是这样……！呜咽。不过，反正观众席的大家也都哭成一片了，应该没关系吧～吸溜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "2c02ecbf427d7eaca32845c553b73a2ed91620e3eb846fe21cc64b6e523c6e06", "ja": "大丈夫じゃないの！　ほら、こっちにいらっしゃい。\nメイク直してあげるから、ほらこっちこっち！", "zh": "才不没问题呢！好啦，快到这边来。\n我来帮你补妆，来来，这边这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "68ba2da494a12716dae5370fa217ec8766a87049130856bbc2a90a070005f959", "ja": "はっ。じゃあ私たちで繋がなくっちゃ……！\nいきましょう、春香ちゃん！", "zh": "啊。那就必须由我们来连接起来才行……！\n走吧，春香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "0ab3cb00e032c5907e0fa714c62256fee4c3de0fb3a01d623c2b20298a816038", "ja": "はいっ！　あ～、その前に千早ちゃん！", "zh": "好的！啊——在那之前，千早！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "3fb116676eb7c6d804a6e1fc5cb62c9764d8fc73b8746ff507d3a0c12a216d3b", "ja": "は、はいっ？", "zh": "是、是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "8193b3edf82a5ccd53bf14d3d6cc8f6e680efb1c1b5246e9f4ae790365d3a6b6", "ja": "今の千早ちゃんのステージ、私、\nしっかり受け止められたって思う。だから……。", "zh": "刚才千早的舞台表演，我觉得自己已经好好感受到了。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "fe21e42df970cc5c615cee82b7d9cbcf5c7dfe5e23cfe91c5db1982884112c4d", "ja": "えへへ。これからも、よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "嘿嘿。今后也请多多关照♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "2ac0fedd56dc062f677647bad82966c507c9803ccac8bbc07cb1d30276c9d112", "ja": "……！　ええ、こちらこそ……。\nこれからも、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "……！嗯，彼此彼此……\n今后也请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "5d75015cea839012803558e3260406552c5138728cc7252da9098471594a32a9", "ja": "もっちろん！　ふふっ♪\nじゃあまた後でね～！", "zh": "那是当然！呵呵♪\n那待会儿见啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "94ad51d66180efe224bbd19bf03b27ee103a810a1791697996e80a315e73258d", "ja": "それから……{$P$}も。\n今回の密着でも、ずっと付き添ってくださって……。", "zh": "然后……也谢谢{$P$}。\n这次贴身采访，您也一直陪在我身边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "e5ebf76d9ee037f27c55a647a0236a6f93e1f5e793256b84cf81e6eeddc4e60c", "ja": "おかげで心のままに話せました。\nこれからも如月千早のこと……よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "多亏了您，我才能发自内心地畅谈。\n今后也请继续支持如月千早。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1022_p", "source_sha256": "fd8bcead2ca45e3ab65a63bd1e70154532aa9e50e5bc27e80fc76cd397cc5bf7", "ja": "こちらこそ、これからも付き添わせてもらうよ。\n千早が心のままに、翼を広げて飛べるように。", "zh": "我才要谢谢你，今后也请让我继续陪在你身边。  \n为了让千早能够随心所欲地展开翅膀飞翔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_102_1023_002chi", "source_sha256": "35bee230d844b3cbfd6132b92584a79fb2ef4a4d5e43d0e77f3eb6f0c0a88a24", "ja": "……。はい、ぜひ……。\nお願いします！", "zh": "……好的，请一定要……拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
